# Paths in the private repository (MallardLabs/matchbox-v2) that never ship
# to the public one (TrelliumOrg). `pnpm release:trellium:prepare` removes
# them from a snapshot and `pnpm check:trellium` fails if one is present.
# One glob per line: `dir/**`, `*` within a segment, `?`; a pattern without
# a slash matches that name at any depth.
#
# The rule: internal documents live only under internal/. Anything about
# machines, credentials, production operations, plans or people goes there.
internal/**

# The private repository's CI runs on the maintainers' own runners. The public
# repository's workflows live in .github/public-workflows and the prepare
# script swaps them in (internal/release/README.md).
.github/workflows/**

# Local release output and agent tool settings.
.trellium-release/**
.claude/**
